OL,3,GNEWSATower blocks demolition plan to be
OL,4,Areconsidered
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe planned demolition of 10 tower
OL,7,Fblocks has been deemed too expensive,
OL,8,Fleading to a council rethink.
OL,10,FStoke-on-Trent City Council said the
OL,11,Festimated cost of knocking down and
OL,12,Fredeveloping the 1970s blocks in
OL,13,FBurslem, Hanley, Stoke and Blurton was
OL,14,F#113.3m. Instead, some or all of them
OL,15,Fcould be refurbished.
OL,17,FAt the time demolition was considered
OL,18,Fsome residents told the BBC about
OL,19,F"damp" and "unclean" conditions, with
OL,20,Fwater seeping through the brickwork and
OL,21,Fused needles left in stairwells.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
